#!ipxe
###
### netboot.xyz-custom menu example
###
:fedora_atomic
menu Fedora Atomic Desktops
item silverblue Silverblue (GNOME)
item kinoite Kinoite (KDE)
item sway_atomic Sway Atomic
item budgie_atomic Budgie Atomic
item cosmic_atomic COSMIC Atomic
item back Voltar
choose target && goto ${target} || goto custom_menu

:silverblue
kernel https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/vmlinuz inst.ks=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/g0newiped/netboot.xyz-custom/master/kickstarts/silverblue.ks
initrd https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/initrd.img
boot

:kinoite
kernel https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/vmlinuz inst.ks=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/g0newiped/netboot.xyz-custom/master/kickstarts/kinoite.ks
initrd https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/initrd.img
boot

:sway_atomic
kernel https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/vmlinuz inst.ks=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/g0newiped/netboot.xyz-custom/master/kickstarts/sway-atomic.ks
initrd https://download.fedoraproject.org/pub/fedora/linux/releases/44/Everything/x86_64/os/images/pxeboot/initrd.img
